<!--
  Release N115-N117: ID number pre-filled on the Cardcom page, staff alert above 25 ₪ per charge, admin-editable email templates.
  Not in this manifest, by design: Cardcom_Setting.Default (edit Max Amount = 40 in Setup in each org, never redeploy the record).
  Sandbox:     sf project deploy start --target-org sandbox -x manifest/release-n115-n117.xml --test-level RunSpecifiedTests --tests CardcomServiceTest DonationLowProfileResourceTest DonorPortalResourceTest StaffAlertServiceTest EmailTemplatesTest DonorEmailServiceTest
  Production:  sf project deploy validate --target-org prod -x manifest/release-n115-n117.xml --test-level RunSpecifiedTests --tests (same list), then sf project deploy quick --job-id <id> --target-org prod
  Stop the Donations jobs first (DonationSetup.request('UNSCHEDULE_ALL');) and schedule them again after (SCHEDULE_ALL).
-->
